    "formData": {
      "partnershipReason": "I am requesting a partnership with The Real Ops Group to grow alongside a team that has a strong focus on teamwork and making every event successful through flawless communication. A partnership would be an amazing opportunity for Echo Convoy Control to expand, while allowing us to support each other whenever large-scale events are taking place.\n\nFurthermore, joining forces will help alleviate the growing pressure from VTCs looking for reliable Convoy Control groups to manage their hosted events. By working together, we can combine our strengths, come closer as a community, and ensure high-quality execution for every convoy.\n\nThank you for considering our partnership request. We look forward to the possibility of working together.\n\nBest regards,\nTheWolf\nEcho Convoy Control - Founder",
      "vtcName": "Echo Convoy Control (No TMP VTC page currently)",
      "submittedAt": "2026-06-22T16:47:14.708Z",
      "discordName": "TheWolf"
    },
    "type": "partnership",
